help:
  image-view / iv <image_path> -> view an image
  help -> get help
  clear -> clean(clear) the screen
  exit -> exit
  verison / ver -> print version
  hex-view -> view a hex file
  ls -> list the files and folders in the current directory
  ls <dir> -> list the files and folders in the <dir> directory
  tree-ls -> list the files and folders in the current directory
  tree-ls <dir> -> list the files and folders in the <dir> directory
  cat <file1> <file2> ... -> view the file(s)
  touch <file1> <file2> ... -> make file(s)
  rm <file1>/<dir1> <file2>/<dir2> ... -> remove file(s) or directory(s)
  mv <old_name> <new_name> -> rename file(s) or directory(s)
  mv <file1> <file2> ... <path> -> move file(s) to directory
